OL,3,GNEWSARoad closure for 'essential' gas  
OL,4,Apipe replacement                       
OL,6,F"Essential" work to replace ageing     
OL,7,Fmetal gas pipes with more durable      
OL,8,Fplastic ones will see a partial road   
OL,9,Fclosure.                               
OL,11,FNorthern Gas Networks is starting      
OL,12,Fnearly three months of works on        
OL,13,FBrotton, Saltburn-by-the-Sea, on 30    
OL,14,FNovember.                              
OL,16,FA one-way road closure will be in place
OL,17,Fstarting from the Brotton Road/A174    
OL,18,Froundabout towards Brotton High Street 
OL,19,Ffor up to three weeks.                 
OL,21,FThe site will then be cleared for two  
OL,22,Fweeks over Christmas.                  
